		<p>Your developer moved on, the agency stopped answering, or the app works but nobody wants to touch it. I start by reviewing the code, hosting and deployment, then tell you plainly what shape it's in and what needs attention first. From there I can upgrade old Laravel and PHP versions, fix what's broken, and get it to a state you can rely on.</p>

